# Exceptions to the file size limits enforced by scripts/check-file-sizes.sh.
#
# One entry per line:   <pattern> <limit>
#
#   pattern  A glob. Without a '/', it matches the file name in any directory
#            (e.g. *.psd). With a '/', it matches the path from the repo root
#            (e.g. docs/images/*.png); '*' also matches across directories.
#            Matching is case-sensitive.
#   limit    e.g. 750KB, 20MB, 1GB (1KB = 1024 bytes), or 'unlimited'.
#
# The last matching line wins. Only the committed version of this file is
# used, so exceptions go through review like any other change.
#
# Examples:
#   assets/hero.png      3MB
#   *.psd                50MB
#   vendor/legacy.min.js 1MB
